.TH CHTTPSVR_CONSTRUCT 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
chttpsvr_construct \- declare and initialise a chttpsvr handle
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpserver.h>

chttpsvr_construct(name, cl);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Declares a chttpsvr variable named name, calls create_chttpsvr(cl),
and assigns the result.  Calls fatal_err() and does not return on
failure.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
name     Identifier for the new handle variable.
cl       Parent logger to derive this server's logger from, or NULL
         to use an internal stderr/FATAL-only logger.  See
         create_chttpsvr_mp for details.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpsvr_construct_scoped (3),
.BR chttpsvr_declare (3),
.BR create_chttpsvr (3)
